# KPI matcher conventions

Canonical docs: `docs/KPI_CARD_CONDITIONS.md`, `docs/PRODUCT_DECISIONS.md`.

## Functions

| Concern | Function |
|---------|----------|
| Me | `matchesRefexMeOnlyScope` |
| Team | `matchesRefexServiceTeamScope` |
| Agent tabs | `matchesRefexTechSupportTab` |
| Manager/Head/Admin | `matchesRefexMonitoringServiceTab` |
| Pending Approval | `matchesRefexApproverPendingTaskRow` |
| Closed ticket | `isRefexServiceClosedTicket` |
| Closed By | `isTicketClosedByUser` |
| Period + today gate | `applyDashboardDateRangeFilter`, `dashboardDateRangeIncludesToday` |

## Do

- Prefer live pending / my-task stamps over report-only guesses for Me Open / Pending.
- Keep Extrovis branches free of Refex L1/L2/feedback activity IDs.
- After matcher changes, run `scripts/test-refex-logic.mjs` when practical and note zip rebuild.

## Don't

- Put IT Tech Reopen on Pending Approval.
- Re-inject live open into past FY ranges.
- Blank KPI state to zeros on soft refresh.
